<title>USA: New York Times reporter wins Pulitzer.</title>
<headline>New York Times reporter wins Pulitzer.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>John F. Burns of The New York Times won the Pulitzer Prize on Monday in journalism for international reporting.</p>
<p>The Pulitzer Prize board at Columbia University cited Burns &quot;for his courageous and insightful coverage of the harrowing regime imposed on Afghanistan by the Taliban.&quot;</p>
</text>
